"name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"HEf0QXnhxrcIWxRfAbQ2iA","review_id":"yNIvmT58WCHAzYViPpxLNQ","date":"2018-07-18T16:19:07","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9552576541900635,"text_excerpt":"Went to Saba for lunch because it was easier to get a reservation for earlier in the day. The interior of the restaurant is beautiful - very bright and open. We ordered 3 things: the Brussels Sprouts Hummus ($14), the Moroccan Carrot Salad ($14), and the Octopus ($14). The hummus was delicious - presented in a similar fashion to how it is at Shaya. The Brussels sprouts are fried, and I found that there was a hint of orange somewhere in the dish but couldn't place where. The hummus in and of itself was delicious. Overall it was really good, but I think I'd try to the Okra one if I go back. The Moroccan Carrot Salad was unreal. I love carrot salads to start with, and this one was absolutely..."},{"business_id":"HEf0QXnhxrcIWxRfAbQ2iA","review_id":"NJI_RQDQfcju6N7KM2f3zg","date":"2018-06-23T06:31:56","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9492027163505554,"text_excerpt":"I made a reservation 1.5 months ago to try Saba. I was super hung over the day of my reservation, but I was determined to make it to the restaurant. Boy, was I glad that my tummy decided to cooperate by dinner time. My friend K and I ordered an assortment of delicious things to enjoy with the fresh pita: lutenitsa, ikra, roasted squash, and hummus with blue crab and corn. We also ordered the octopus and the lamb kebab. Everyone knows how good the fresh pita is so I won't go into detail on that, but if you have never had the lutenitsa, go eat some! It's probably one of my favorite things ever! I also really enjoyed the hummus with crab. I was a little worried that it could be a little fish..."},{"business_id":"HEf0QXnhxrcIWxRfAbQ2iA","review_id":"YRTK1bLy_Q-dipKEJM1J8Q","date":"2021-04-21T20:28:36","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.949176013469696,"text_excerpt":"Had a great experience at Saba this weekend. They were very busy, so we sat at the bar and received excellent service the entire meal. We tried all of the salatim and the blue crab hummus. I highly recommend sampling the entire salatim menu, it was a lot of fun and we got to try a lot of items we normally would not have ordered. It was plenty for two people. The blue crab hummus is divine and I dream of the pita bread. Honestly. Absolutely delicious. Their drinks were also super creative and delicious. I hope to be back soon!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"HEf0QXnhxrcIWxRfAbQ2iA","photo_id":"eXBMluXB20t5MEEzDYQ9vA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/eXBMluXB20t5MEEzDYQ9vA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8569738864898682},{"business_id":"HEf0QXnhxrcIWxRfAbQ2iA","photo_id":"MNL1w48CPN-f1K1XA9x0cg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/MNL1w48CPN-f1K1XA9x0cg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8363454341888428},{"business_id":"HEf0QXnhxrcIWxRfAbQ2iA","photo_id":"-bBz2HHkzz1-5e-gPCgN8g","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/-bBz2HHkzz1-5e-gPCgN8g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8327866792678833},{"business_id":"HEf0QXnhxrcIWxRfAbQ2iA","photo_id":"xQFOjpaU2UExzJc8eSYX7Q","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/xQFOjpaU2UExzJc8eSYX7Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8214326500892639},{"business_id":"HEf0QXnhxrcIWxRfAbQ2iA","photo_id":"ANojFXnRsxXYdd2lO